Has Seen Operator Note
OpSawNote

This field indicates whether the corresponding operator has seen the Operator/System Note since it was saved into the system.\
\
Business Rules:\
- When an operator record is created, this flag should be set to TRUE if there is an operator note, FALSE otherwise.\
- When an operator record is modified, this flag should not be modified.\
- When the Operator note is created or modified, this flag should be set for all the operator records.\
- When the Operator note is deleted, this flag should be cleared for all the operator records.

