PSTimSl

We discussed that there could be some value in knowing which products users find quickly and which products users have difficulty in finding. This field could accumulate an estimation of the time users need to select a product, which\\
 divided by the number of selections would provide an average time. This information might be of help if the customer is wondering whether an item is not very 'visible' to users.

